==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Lilligant|5}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*'''Leaf Supply''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Sceptile|31}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

